    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Seminar was held on Nov 29, 2016 through VC. AKU staff from various locations of AKU campuses across East Africa and Pakistan participated in the seminar. The Seminar engaged the participants in the discussion of unpacking the term \"Critical Thinking\". The presenter of the seminar shared a few examples from the real classroom promoting the Critical Thinking among students."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
